     "headerLink": "",
     "type": "mask_imgtext",
     "title": "Happiness lies in simplicity",
     "text": "<p>How easily one can find happiness. Beyond the wealth of the tangible and intangible lies a place surrounded by pristine nature, one that touches you with its simplicity: like the feeling of soft, forest-scented moss under your feet, or marvelling at the unique crystalline forms of snowflakes, like the feeling of being completely grounded.&nbsp;In this very moment. In happiness.</p>",
