     "headerLink": "",
     "type": "mask_imgtext",
     "title": "Just as it was thousands of years ago",
     "text": "<p>Memories of days without a care in the world, hearts energised by untamed lightness and boundless freedom: the love for this tiny corner of the planet pulsates in rhythm with an appreciation for life, where every moment lived becomes a precious moment experienced with all the senses – as elemental as nature passing through the seasons, as constant as the mountain with its millions of years of age. Here's to a carefree way of life!</p>",
